#: assets/maps/tilesets/indoor.tsx:
msgid "The weather is good today."
msgstr "C'è bel tempo oggi."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/indoor.tsx:
msgid "A painting that depicts this area long ago."
msgstr "Un dipinto che raffigura questa zona tempo fa."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/indoor.tsx:
msgid "It's full of books here."
msgstr "È pieno di libri qui."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/indoor.tsx:
msgid "A closed door."
